<title>HONG KONG: K. Wah Int'l interim profit up 37.1 pct.</title>
<headline>K. Wah Int'l interim profit up 37.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.2    vs  6.7 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5    vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    82.79  vs  60.37</p>
<p>    Turnover		     985.64 vs  566.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 K. Wah International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 14</p>
<p>NOTE - K. Wah International engages in property development, manufacturing and sales of construction materials.</p>
<p>Shares earnings were adjusted for the scrip shares issued during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
